   "body": "Another test of this class: TestCodexServedKeptWhileCatalogStays went red once in `go test -count=5 ./internal/agent -run 'WSL|Reach|Unreach|Codex|ClaudeScience'` on mica (at the redact-wsl-1700 branch, rebased on 5b25d7e9e): `codex_served_kept_test.go:67: a set already found took 312464 bytes, finding it 5393792`. Just before it, the log has `codex rollouts: 1 written portable` from an earlier test's goroutine. Alone, with -count=10, it passed 10/10. Its bytesPer reads runtime.MemStats.TotalAlloc for the whole process, like the test this issue is about.",
   "author_association": "OWNER",
